   "key": "electrical.sample_connections",
   "why": "The text says 'Up to 12 DC and 2 RF connections are possible with side panel feedthroughs'. Sample mounts are offered as 'RF/DC, RF only, DC only, flat sample plate, custom' ('with and without electrical connections'). The configuration_basis names no electrical sample mount, so connections at the sample are not established for this configuration. To accept, add an RF/DC sample mount to the configuration."
  },
  {
   "configuration_id": "montana_cryoadvance_100_onek_optic",
   "key": "electrical.dc_lines",
   "why": "12 is an 'up to ... possible' maximum that depends on the chosen sample mount (a flat plate has none). Storing it as an installed count overstates what this configuration has. Accept only once the configuration fixes an RF/DC mount."
  },
  {
   "configuration_id": "montana_cryoadvance_100_onek_optic",
